three-ways.code:
The same job, "mark task 42 as done", in three styles.

Resources     PATCH /tasks/42
              { "status": "done" }

Procedures    POST /tracker.TaskService/CompleteTask
              { "task_id": "42" }

Queries       POST /graphql
              mutation {
                completeTask(id: "42") { id status }
              }

And as an event, sent to subscribers afterwards:

              { "type": "task.completed",
                "data": { "task_id": "42" } }
